                    Greece, <ref target="#pg380">p. 380</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d205-f3" n="24" xml:id="d205-f3-content">
                <p>The French text reads: “celle-ci est prévue dans.”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
